{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285940/extras/reviews.png?t=1744487678\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hollow Survivors</strong>\u00a0is a\u00a0rogue-like dungeon crawler where you play as one of the few remaining sane Hollows. Slash through hordes of\u00a0<i>horrific</i> creatures and fight your way to the <i>top of the\u00a0Tower</i>. Discover new weapons and upgrades, and confront the evil cult that turned you into a Hollow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285940/extras/PortalPierceCroppedOpt.gif?t=1744487678\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FACE POWERFUL ENEMIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash your fury, <strong>crush your enemies</strong> and triumph over <strong>menacing bosses</strong> that stand in your path. Nothing can stop you from achieving your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285940/extras/FaceEnemiesCroppedOpt.gif?t=1744487678\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHOOSE YOUR WEAPON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick a weapon that best suits your combat style. Use a <strong>swift scythe</strong> to quickly cut down your enemies or wield a <strong>great axe</strong> to overwhelm them with power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285940/extras/WeaponChoiceCroppedOpt.gif?t=1744487678\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GROW STRONGER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is not the end in Hollow Survivors. Utilize the souls you gather to purchase <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> from other Hollows, ensuring that you grow stronger with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285940/extras/GROW_STRONGER.gif?t=1744487678\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BEFRIEND OTHER HOLLOWS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your <strong>relationships</strong> with other Hollows, uncover dark secrets, and <strong>rebuild</strong> the settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285940/extras/BefriendHollowsCropped.gif?t=1744487678\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNIQUE BUILD = UNIQUE LOOK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each soul-card you select directly influences your character's <i>appearance</i>. Every unique combination creates a distinct look for the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285940/extras/UniqueLookCropped.gif?t=1744487678\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy <strong>cosmetic upgrades</strong> to craft a unique look for your character. From subtle tweaks to dramatic transformations, you have the freedom to customize your hero exactly how you envision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285940/extras/CustomizeCropped.gif?t=1744487678\" /></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience an exciting action-packed adventure where your choices and skills determine your fate. <strong>Will you rise to the <i>ultimate test</i>?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hollow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2285940/cfaec3697d1bbd00665f72e3753561fd6905ff3f.jpg"},{"name":"Forest's End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2285940/345ee03041a89bb4da98cf931ff4f9f58c9271f6.jpg"},{"name":"Flame Weaver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2285940/4cd5c1704a8e35eb49c3d95e100d72b3b7